<title>USA: Hempstead, N.Y., to sell $82 mln GOs on Feb 14.</title>
<headline>Hempstead, N.Y., to sell $82 mln GOs on Feb 14.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Town of Hempstead, N.Y., said it plans to sell $82 million of general obligation bonds on February 14.</p>
<p>The bonds will be sold through competitive auction at 1100 EST.</p>
<p>The financial adviser is Public Finance Associates.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
